    "type": "block",
    "title": "Nwando Achebe - Love, Courtship, and Marriage in Africa",
    "text": "Among the over 35 million Igbo people of eastern Nigeria and Cameroon, for instance, the word for \"love\" or \"to love\" is ifu na anya -- which literally translates into \"to see you with my eyes\". \"I love you\" in the same language is afum gi naanya, literally, \"I see you with my eyes\".",
    "url": "https://www.are.na/block/25266334",
    "published_at": "2023-12-17T20:18:43.000Z",
    "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T16:09:01.296Z",
    "images": [],
    "tags": [],
    "visibility": "public",
    "meta": {
      "block_type": "Text",
